      "content": "idk i dont really want to go to the er or anything if i can help it. it's kinda expensive and the wait is always forever. i was thinking maybe i could just do some really intense deep stretches to try and loosen everything up? or even like a back cracking thing to reset my spine so it feels right again? would that help get the pressure off?",
